Government, build again, and put it back.

5
00:00:16.113 --> 00:00:20.481
The second build exits one: Learn
documents the proof-of-possession

6
00:00:20.481 --> 00:00:23.913
policy only for Azure
commercial, so nothing is built.

7
00:00:23.913 --> 00:00:26.088
Step six checks the read-backs.

8
00:00:26.088 --> 00:00:30.475
The extension and the leaver workflow
both come back with no findings.

9
00:00:30.475 --> 00:00:32.906
Then move the custom task to the front of

10
00:00:32.906 --> 00:00:35.337
a copy of the workflow,
and check the copy.

11
00:00:35.337 --> 00:00:39.014
Two W X oh three findings:
Disable user account,

12
00:00:39.014 --> 00:00:43.950
and Revoke all refresh tokens,
don't run before the custom task.

13
00:00:43.950 --> 00:00:45.063
Block first.

14
00:00:45.063 --> 00:00:46.312
Exit code two.

15
00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.825
Step seven runs the tests: fifty-five, OK.

16
00:00:49.825 --> 00:00:51.260
